Chapter: SHA1 Vector Test
  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites Foreword chapter Sha1

 SHA-1 known-answer test against the digests published in FIPS 180-1
 and RFC 3174. The one-block message, the empty message, and the
 two-block 56-byte message, which is the one that exercises the
 padding overflow into a second block.

Section: Vector

  abc-bytes : List Integer = [97, 98, 99]

  long-bytes : List Integer = [
    97, 98, 99, 100, 98, 99, 100, 101, 99, 100, 101, 102, 100, 101, 102, 103,
    101, 102, 103, 104, 102, 103, 104, 105, 103, 104, 105, 106, 104, 105, 106, 107,
    105, 106, 107, 108, 106, 107, 108, 109, 107, 108, 109, 110, 108, 109, 110, 111,
    109, 110, 111, 112, 110, 111, 112, 113
  ]

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("abc=" & sha1-to-hex (sha1 abc-bytes))
    print-line-uni ("empty=" & sha1-to-hex (sha1 []))
    print-line-uni ("long=" & sha1-to-hex (sha1 long-bytes))
    print-line-uni ("abc-again=" & sha1-to-hex (sha1 abc-bytes))
    print-line-uni ("nbytes=" & show (list-length (sha1-bytes abc-bytes)))
  end

